      "limitations": [
        "the adaptation rate, alphabet size and shipped context are fixed a priori for this seal; tuning them on held-out data is not permitted",
        "the escape and low bits pay raw bits, so the model's advantage is confined to the coarse high part",
        "the ablation variants are encoder-only analyses and are never decoded; only the shipped context is a bitstream"
      ],
